	 of the Palme d’Or at Cannes 2026. The Gheorghius\, a devout Romanian Norw
	egian couple\, resettle in a village set in a distant fjord where they bec
	ome close to their neighbours\, the Halbergs. Their children bond despite 
	their different education. When adolescent Elia Gheorghiu shows up at scho
	ol with some bruises on her body\, the community asks itself if the tradit
	ional education that the Gheorghiu children get from their parents might h
	ave anything to do with it.\n\nMedverkande: Renate Reinsve\, Sebastian Sta
	n\, Lisa Carlehed\, Lisa Loven Kongsli\, Giulia Nahmany\, Ingvild Lien\, A
